id: long-press-menu
section: Chrome, menus and dialogs
item: Hold on a link: the long-press menu comes up over the page (the frame changes where it stands) and a tap outside takes it away; a plain tap on the link is unaffected (it navigates)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-card-events.html
kit: cavekit-ui-shell.md R7
